;; The mono coordinate for the dev practices rather than the code: the
;; ADRs, recipes, slide deck, Tessl plugins, hook library, semgrep rules
;; and justfiles that `just mono-import` lays down in this tree at this
;; sha. Nothing puts it
;; on a classpath, so it is free to sit on a different tag from ../mono
;; when a release changes only the practices, or only the code. Bump all
;; five shims together anyway unless there is a reason not to.
{:deps {com.repldriven.mono/dev {:git/url "https://github.com/repldriven/mono.git"
                                 :git/tag "v0.0.40"
                                 :git/sha "724d64e2721757121630bf77d26c864871ebc150"}}}
